## git
*.swp
*.swo
*.log

## Sublime Text
*.sublime-workspace

## Python
## Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/

## Mac stuff
.DS_store

## C compiler files
*.o
*.a

## Tap Revolution runtime settings (defaults/example are tracked; persistent isn't)
config/tap_revolution.yaml
itl_online_charts/*
audio/*

## Run-once signing: never commit a private key. Public keys (keys/runonce/*.pem)
## ARE tracked; private keys live outside the repo (~/.nixie_runonce/).
*priv*.pem
*_priv.pem
*private*.pem
.signing_keys/
